docs/1698797636713486","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1698797636713486","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"获取投放素材数据-数据报表-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1745207002572807","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1745207002572807","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7666424236554063167","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7666424236554063167","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671239315024215525","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671239315024215525","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7666410545121103104","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7666410545121103104","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"}]},{"id":"CMCR-CMP-20260819-C2-Q0026","q":"CMCR-Q0026","question":"千川素材库在哪里看，能看到哪些素材和投放数据？","day":1,"repeat":2,"valid":true,"answer":"# 千川素材库（素材管理/视频库）\n## 一、PC端入口（千川后台）\n1. **素材库（素材存储）**：登录千川PC后台`qianchuan.jinritemai.com` →【工具】→【创意管理/素材管理】→【视频库】，这就是账户素材库，存放本地上传、推送过来的全部图片、视频、图文素材。\n> 视频库主要看**素材文件本身**，基础标签（优质素材、低质素材），**不展示完整投放数据**。\n\n2. **素材投放数据查看入口**：【数据】→【素材分析】，这里看每条素材真实投放效果数据。\n\n> 移动端小店随心推没有完整素材库，仅在建计划时选择素材，无法批量管理素材库。\n\n## 二、素材库【视频库】可以看到哪些素材\n- 本地上传的视频、图片、图文轮播素材\n- 第三方工具推送到千川账户的素材\n- 素材状态：审核通过/审核中/拒绝、优质素材标签、低质素材标签、素材时长、大小、格式、上传时间\n- 支持预览素材、搜索、筛选、删除、重新上传、查看素材审核详情\n\n> ⚠️视频库页面**看不到消耗、ROI、点击率这类投放数据**，投放数据要去【数据-素材分析】。\n\n## 三、素材分析页面可查看的投放数据指标\n进入【数据】→【素材分析】，可自定义列，能看到：\n1. **曝光点击类**：展现量、点击量、点击率CTR、千次展现成本CPM\n2. **消耗成本类**：素材消耗、平均点击成本CPC\n3. **转化成交类**：成交订单数、成交金额、直接ROI、转化成本、转化率\n4. **视频质量类**：3秒留存、完播率、平均观看时长\n5. 可区分推直播、推商品，支持按时间筛选，支持导出报表\n\n## 补充区分\n- **视频库（工具模块）**：管素材文件，存素材、看审核状态，**无投放数据**\n- **素材分析（数据模块）**：管投放效果，看素材跑出来的数据，**不能上传管理素材**\n\n> 如果页面找不到入口，可点千川右下角智投星联系官方客服咨询。\n\n需要我给你一份千川素材分析常用筛选和看数据的简单实操要点吗？","answerHash":"dbf526bec6dea1948ea53dd9bb03cc359296ec2fd99c14e08d1829e377cf061d","finishedAt":"2026-08-18","replacement":false,"brands":[],"sources":[{"title":"📃【超级编导--巨量千川/广告】分发使用帮助","url":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/chao-ji-bian-dao-ju-liang-qian-chuan-guang-gao-su-cai-fen-fa-shi-yong-bang-zhu","normalizedUrl":"https://help.superdir.cn/docs/chao-ji-bian-dao-ju-liang-qian-chuan-guang-gao-su-cai-fen-fa-shi-yong-bang-zhu","domain":"help.superdir.cn","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音电商","url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8APt?from=douyinofficial_table%2F1000&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","normalizedUrl":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8APt?from=douyinofficial_table%2F1000&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&should_hide_bottom_nav=1","domain":"school.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"权限点与接口关系-入门指南-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1699625068225550","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1699625068225550","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"抖音","url":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671535524846259510","normalizedUrl":"https://iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671535524846259510","domain":"iesdouyin.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"获取全域投放计划下素材-千川PC全域投放-商业开放平台","url":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1804363488115850","normalizedUrl":"https://open.oceanengine.com/docs/1804363488115850","domain":"open.oceanengine.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"},{"title":"巨量千川入口 - 产品介绍 - 巨量千川帮助中心","url":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213224","normalizedUrl":"https://qianchuan.jinritemai.com/docs/help/11747/213224","domain":"qianchuan.jinritemai.com","validUrl":true,"contentStatus":"页面内容未核验"